\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs28\b\qc\cf1 Privacy Policy\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs22\qc Version 3.0.1 - October 2026\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs22\qc Personnel Management System (SDEP_CPP5)\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs22\qc LiebeBlack Systems\par
\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22 This document explains how personal data is collected, used, stored and protected when installing and using the Personnel Management System ("SDEP_CPP5" or "the Software"), developed by LiebeBlack Systems.\par
\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\b 1. DATA CONTROLLER\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22 LiebeBlack Systems is the developer and distributor of the Software. The Software is installed locally on Licensee's computers and does not send personal data to LiebeBlack servers or third parties, unless Licensee explicitly configures synchronization with their own central node.\par
\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\b 2. DATA PROCESSED\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22 The Software may process the following categories of personal data, exclusively under Licensee's control:\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\tab (a) User identification data (username, full name, ID number, role);\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\tab (b) Authentication data (password hashes, never plaintext passwords, session tokens);\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\tab (c) Labor and payroll data entered by Licensee (employees, contracts, payments, incidents, academic grades);\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\tab (d) Audit logs (date, time, IP address, user, action performed, result);\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\tab (e) Technical data (device identifier, system version, synchronization device identifier).\par
\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\b 3. PURPOSE OF PROCESSING\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22 Data is processed exclusively for the following purposes:\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\tab (a) Personnel management, payroll, human resources and academic administration of Licensee;\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\tab (b) User authentication and authorization;\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\tab (c) Data synchronization between workstations and authorized mobile devices;\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\tab (d) Auditing of actions and traceability of changes;\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\tab (e) Generation of reports, statistics and management documents.\par
\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\b 4. LEGAL BASIS\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22 Data processing is based on:\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\tab (a) Licensee's consent to install and configure the Software;\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\tab (b) Compliance with legal obligations in labor, tax and social security matters;\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\tab (c) Licensee's legitimate interest in internal management of its organization.\par
\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\b 5. RECIPIENTS AND TRANSFERS\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22 The Software does not transfer personal data to LiebeBlack or third parties. Data remains on computers and servers under Licensee's exclusive control. If Licensee configures synchronization between workstations, data travels exclusively within its local network, encrypted, and does not leave its infrastructure without express authorization.\par
\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\b 6. DATA SUBJECT RIGHTS\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22 Persons whose data is processed through the Software have the right to:\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\tab (a) Access their personal data;\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\tab (b) Request rectification of inaccurate or incomplete data;\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\tab (c) Request erasure of their data when no longer necessary;\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\tab (d) Restrict or object to processing of their data;\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\tab (e) Receive their data in a structured, commonly used format (portability).\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22 Licensee is responsible for attending to and responding to data subject rights requests, in accordance with applicable legislation.\par
\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\b 7. DATA SECURITY\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22 The Software implements appropriate technical and organizational measures, including:\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\tab (a) Password encryption using PBKDF2 algorithm;\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\tab (b) 256-bit session tokens, stored hashed;\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\tab (c) Account locking after failed attempts;\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\tab (d) Auditing of all relevant actions;\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\tab (e) Role-based and module-based access control;\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\tab (f) Optionally, biometric unlock on mobile devices.\par
\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\b 8. DATA RETENTION\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22 Data is retained for as long as necessary for processing purposes and to comply with legal obligations. Licensee is responsible for establishing retention policies and deleting data that is no longer necessary.\par
\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\b 9. CONTACT AND COMPLAINTS\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22 To exercise rights, raise queries or submit complaints related to this document or to data processing performed through the Software, contact Licensee's data controller or:\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22 LiebeBlack Systems\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22 Email: privacy@liebeblack.com\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22 Web: https://github.com/LiebeBlack/SDEP_CPP5\par
\par
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f1\fs22\b\qc END OF PRIVACY POLICY\cf0\b0\par
